{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:701","content":{"id":701,"title":"删除有序数组中的重复项","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"67aad1cb-46fd-4500-aa9a-505be82b2b57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除有序数组中的重复项"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"362b9f47-9bff-4b10-8d7d-11dc7638a860","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c36aab42-d2d2-44c7-a636-689685eea630","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个有序数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，请你"},{"type":"formatted","color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)","text":"原地"},{"type":"formatted","text":"删除重复出现的元素，使每个元素 只出现一次 ，返回删除后数组的新长度。不要使用额外的数组空间，你必须在"},{"type":"formatted","color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)","text":"原地"},{"type":"formatted","text":"修改输入数组并在使用 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(1)","collabId":"f192acd7-11e2-411a-ac2d-637cc2fb1cbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 额外空间的条件下完成。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b0d94381-affe-400e-bcce-f8540b070dab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"b04636b2-9374-46d8-ab68-2529af26ae96","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"19605b76-c45f-4fa9-8be4-51ace639afef","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [1,1,2]\n输出：2, nums = [1,2]","collabId":"a5dc242c-c49e-4050-8481-3d642b2c11c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"102ab92f-eeb4-46b6-925d-a3ab6994aaa0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"32686fd4-50bb-4fc1-bf50-32f41611117b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d3eedba2-00a1-4273-92b3-d62116aec545","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [0,0,1,1,1,2,2,3,3,4]\n输出：5, nums = [0,1,2,3,4]","collabId":"3db349d2-3ba5-4bc9-8a89-1549202048db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"b4b1fbe8-eda9-47e3-b080-fd0c56253ad3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91f9ad5c-8c05-4ffb-a7df-d7c95bf52dd1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们遍历数组时，我们使用数组已遍历的部分保存不重复的元素，定义两个指针，指针 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"size"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指向无重复部分的末尾，指针 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cur"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指向当前正在遍历的元素，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[size - 1] != nums[cur]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，说明 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[cur]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个元素是第一次出现的，应当将它添加到无重复数组的末尾，并且 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"size++"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"f1d8e6fb-4256-4fa9-b1c8-14f335f75803","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"40ccf32e-b490-403c-9b33-d3edbe9c463f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int removeDuplicates(int[] nums) {\n    if (nums.length == 0) {\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    int size = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        if (nums[size - 1] != nums[i]) {\n            nums[size] = nums[i];\n            size++;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    return size;\n}","collabId":"f368510a-c835-4f6f-a2f0-b10945ef1941","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"ef605865-db0e-4a3f-b295-569d1d0a10b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除有序数组中的重复项II"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"7df93519-bd10-47b0-9d4b-5f1e8d46a463","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c0b07419-e2c7-42d6-bd8d-56695e88521c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个有序数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，请你原地删除重复出现的元素，使每个元素最多出现"},{"type":"formatted","color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)","text":"两次"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，返回删除后数组的新长度。不要使用额外的数组空间，你必须在原地修改输入数组 并在使用 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(1)","collabId":"c6c15309-120c-4cc0-8a82-785aadaba6bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 额外空间的条件下完成。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"188c52cf-a05e-4c4c-a17e-d3dc66f824e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8cb961b2-0392-4118-ad06-b47c412a4fb7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同上面一样，定义两个指针 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"size"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cur"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这道题要求每个元素最多出现两次，那我们比较 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[size - 2]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[cur]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果二者不同，说明 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[cur]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 没有出现两次，这时可以将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[cur]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 添加至 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"size"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处，并进行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"size++"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"61389fe0-2493-4faf-9ef1-24f93e5fec79","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5914abda-436f-4f23-a4a0-d41509bb79d9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public static int removeDuplicates(int[] nums) {\n    int len = nums.length;\n    if(len<=2){\n        return len;\n    }\n\n    int size = 2;\n    int cur = 2;\n    while(cur < len){\n        if(nums[size - 2] != nums[cur]){\n            nums[size++] = nums[cur];\n        }\n        cur++;\n    }\n    return size;\n}","collabId":"4d3d779a-e6b0-4071-9997-67a30257812b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"96038785-ab88-49d4-a9ce-3221bfc6c3d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"8305d1ec-2a06-4a50-af79-a7869e0a4192","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"61f2d2d7-0d29-4d36-8052-5488df1794f2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContra